<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  floppy's Interpretation (mosfet abilities/listening/interpretation.py):
  the slow half of listening, which works out what a scored sound turns
  out to be. The listening (abilities/listening.scx) invokes it as its
  long-lived child "interpretation" and hands it each scored sound.

    initializing -> Interpretation {
      Idle -bot.ability.listening.sensitivity.output-> Working {
        DetectingVoice -> Idle | HandingOff | ClassifyingSound
                        | IdentifyingVoiceDirect | HearingSpeech
        HearingSpeech -scored sound-> FeedingSpeech
        FeedingSpeech -> HearingSpeech | SpeechEnded
        SpeechEnded -> DiarizingVoice | DecodingSpeech | Idle
        ClassifyingSound -> HandingOff | Idle
        DiarizingVoice -> IdentifyingVoice | DecodingSpeech.Diarized | HandingOff
        IdentifyingVoiceDirect -> HearingSpeech
        IdentifyingVoice -> HandingOff
        DecodingSpeech { Detected, Diarized } -> HandingOff
        HandingOff -> Idle }
      Working -bot.ability.listening.stage.failed-> Idle }

  Configuration (mosfet's constructor, as <data>): the voice activity
  classifier is required, so voice detection always runs;
  sound_classification (KindSoundClassifier), speech_decoding,
  voice_diarization and voice_identification say which optional stages are
  configured, product_threshold_db is mosfet's 3 dB, and stage_timeout_ms
  is mosfet's 30 s stage operation timeout. floppy's bot configures voice
  detection, sound classification and speech decoding (the phase 6 plan:
  speech is decoded in listening). Voice identification with speech
  decoding is refused, as mosfet's constructor refuses it (embedding
  correlation would be lost): initializing ends in the final state
  degraded, and the listening degrades.

  Input: bot.ability.listening.sensitivity.output {sound, parent,
  perceived_level_db} (mosfet's sensitivity OutputData) from the
  listening. Scored sounds that arrive while Working wait, in order, in
  the data model queue and are taken by Idle and HearingSpeech (mosfet
  defers them): interpretation is serial, and the score was taken on
  arrival.

  Stages, each a child invoked from its state (leaving the state cancels
  it, SCXML 6.4) and bounded by its own stage timer:
  bot.ability.listening.stage.failed {stage, message: "Listening <stage>
  timed out."} sent to this session after stage_timeout_ms.

  * DetectingVoice and FeedingSpeech invoke abilities/voice_detection.scx:
    the sound normalized to PCM (mosfet's _pcm_sound_data; a WAV
    container's PCM is written beside it as floppy-sound-<n>.pcm) and its
    voice spans (mosfet's ApplyData). With no voice: dropped when only
    speech decoding is configured, handed off as a silence observation
    when nothing else is, else classified. With voice: identified directly
    (voice identification without diarization), else the open-speech
    window opens (mosfet's VAD Start).
  * HearingSpeech is the open-speech window: each scored sound goes to
    FeedingSpeech, still voiced it joins the utterance and the window stays
    open, and the first one without voice joins it and closes it
    (mosfet's VAD End) in SpeechEnded. The utterance is the list
    open_frames (each frame's PCM reference and format; mosfet appends the
    bytes), and the loudest frame is open_sensed. While the window is open and neither speech
    decoding nor diarization owns the product, each frame is streamed as
    an acoustic bot.ability.listening.speech.output (its PCM, its voice
    spans, and the identity direct identification found), when audible.
  * SpeechEnded joins the open speech into one utterance file with the
    speech service's append step when diarization or decoding will read
    it, then diarizes, else decodes, else returns to Idle. The utterance
    is always a WAV container (floppy-utterance-<n>.wav): mosfet hands its
    decoder bytes in the ingress format, but floppy hands the decoder a
    file, and transcription APIs read a container, not raw PCM.
  * ClassifyingSound invokes abilities/sound_classification.scx: a
    labelled sound is non-speech and is handed off as the original
    environment.sound; an unlabelled one is dropped when speech decoding
    is configured, else handed off as a silence observation.
  * DiarizingVoice invokes abilities/voice_diarization.scx on the
    utterance (its clipped segments are floppy-diarized-<n>-<index>).
  * IdentifyingVoiceDirect invokes abilities/voice_identification.scx on
    the opening voice span (clipped to floppy-voice-<n>.pcm); its one
    embedding becomes the window's source identity. IdentifyingVoice
    embeds each diarized segment. Exactly one embedding per segment.
  * DecodingSpeech invokes abilities/speech_decoding.scx (the speech
    service) on the utterance: decoding rewrites the observation into
    words.
  * HandingOff is the one comparison (mosfet _is_audible_product): a
    product whose perceived_level_db is null or at least
    product_threshold_db goes to the listening; a quieter one is dropped.
    The products (mosfet _dispatch_product_cognition_input): decoded
    speech as bot.ability.listening.speech.output with content the words
    and content_type text/plain (a sound with no sample rate fails, as in
    mosfet); one speech product per diarized segment (its PCM, span,
    confidence, and, after identification, its embedding as its source
    identity); a silence observation as a speech product of the sound's
    PCM; a labelled sound, or a sound that is not PCM, as the original
    environment.sound.

  Files are written in the directory of the sound's audio reference, the
  directory the run grants the speech service.

  Failure: a stage failure (its child's failure, an error, or its timer)
  answers the listening with bot.ability.listening.failed {stage, message}
  (mosfet's FailedEventData) and returns to Idle; Idle clears the open
  speech.

  Readiness: on start it sends bot.ability.offers {ability:
  "interpretation", choices: []} to the listening; it offers nothing.

  Contracts: the events it takes reference abilities/schemas/ by
  event:schema (never inline). The stages' results are done.invoke
  <donedata>, which scxml.rs does not check, so their shape is checked by
  cond.

  Bindings: the speech service for the append step (no backend); the
  stages bind their own services.
-->
<scxml xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml"
       xmlns:event="https://github.com/stateforward/scxml.rs/namespaces/event"
       version="1.0" datamodel="ecmascript" name="interpretation" initial="initializing">
  <datamodel>
    <!-- Configuration (mosfet's constructor). -->
    <data id="product_threshold_db" expr="3.0"/>
    <data id="stage_timeout_ms" expr="30000"/>
    <data id="sound_classifier" expr="true"/>
    <data id="speech_decoder" expr="true"/>
    <data id="diarizer" expr="false"/>
    <data id="voice_classifier" expr="false"/>
    <!-- Scored sounds waiting for the interpretation. -->
    <data id="queue" expr="[]"/>
    <!-- The scored sound in hand, its stage, its directory, and a counter
         naming the files written for it. -->
    <data id="sensed" expr="null"/>
    <data id="stage" expr="null"/>
    <data id="media_dir" expr="''"/>
    <data id="serial" expr="0"/>
    <!-- The current frame's detection {sensed, voice_detection}, and what
         HandingOff hands off {kind, sensed, voice_detection, ...}. -->
    <data id="detection" expr="null"/>
    <data id="completion" expr="null"/>
    <data id="result" expr="null"/>
    <!-- The open speech (mosfet's open utterance). -->
    <data id="open_frames" expr="[]"/>
    <data id="open_sensed" expr="null"/>
    <data id="active_source_ids" expr="[]"/>
    <data id="active_voice_embedding" expr="null"/>
    <data id="utterance" expr="null"/>
    <!-- HandingOff's working values. -->
    <data id="audible" expr="false"/>
    <data id="product" expr="null"/>
    <data id="mismatch" expr="null"/>
    <data id="channels" expr="1"/>
    <data id="segment" expr="null"/>
    <data id="index" expr="0"/>
  </datamodel>

  <!-- mosfet's constructor refuses identification with decoding. -->
  <state id="initializing">
    <transition cond="voice_classifier &amp;&amp; speech_decoder" target="degraded">
      <log label="interpretation.degraded" expr="'voice identification cannot be combined with speech decoding'"/>
    </transition>
    <transition target="Interpretation"/>
  </state>

  <state id="Interpretation" initial="Idle">
    <onentry>
      <send event="bot.ability.offers" target="#_parent">
        <param name="ability" expr="'interpretation'"/>
        <param name="choices" expr="[]"/>
      </send>
    </onentry>

    <!-- Scored sounds queue here, one at a time; the open speech is clear
         whenever the interpretation is idle. -->
    <state id="Idle">
      <onentry>
        <assign location="open_frames" expr="[]"/>
        <assign location="open_sensed" expr="null"/>
        <assign location="active_source_ids" expr="[]"/>
        <assign location="active_voice_embedding" expr="null"/>
        <assign location="utterance" expr="null"/>
        <assign location="stage" expr="null"/>
      </onentry>
      <transition cond="queue.length &gt; 0" target="DetectingVoice">
        <assign location="sensed" expr="queue.shift()"/>
      </transition>
      <transition event="bot.ability.listening.sensitivity.output" event:schema="schemas/bot.ability.listening.sensitivity.output.json"
                  cond="!_event.invokeid" target="DetectingVoice">
        <assign location="sensed" expr="_event.data"/>
      </transition>
    </state>

    <!-- One busy region: the queue and the stage failure policy live
         once, not on every stage. -->
    <state id="Working" initial="DetectingVoice">
      <transition event="bot.ability.listening.sensitivity.output" event:schema="schemas/bot.ability.listening.sensitivity.output.json"
                  cond="!_event.invokeid">
        <assign location="queue" expr="queue.concat([_event.data])"/>
      </transition>
      <transition event="bot.ability.listening.stage.failed" event:schema="schemas/bot.ability.listening.stage.failed.json"
                  cond="!_event.invokeid &amp;&amp; _event.data.stage === stage" target="Idle">
        <send event="bot.ability.listening.failed" target="#_parent">
          <content expr="_event.data"/>
        </send>
      </transition>
      <!-- A stage child that cannot run. -->
      <transition event="error.*" cond="stage !== null">
        <send event="bot.ability.listening.stage.failed" target="#_internal">
          <content expr="({stage: stage, message: 'Listening ' + stage + ' could not run (' + _event.name + ')'})"/>
        </send>
      </transition>
      <!-- A stage child's failure (its <donedata> {message}). -->
      <transition event="done.invoke" cond="stage !== null &amp;&amp; typeof Object(_event.data).message === 'string'">
        <send event="bot.ability.listening.stage.failed" target="#_internal">
          <content expr="({stage: stage, message: _event.data.message})"/>
        </send>
      </transition>

      <!-- Voice detection on a sound with the window closed. -->
      <state id="DetectingVoice">
        <onentry>
          <assign location="stage" expr="'voice_detection'"/>
          <assign location="detection" expr="null"/>
          <assign location="serial" expr="serial + 1"/>
          <assign location="media_dir" expr="sensed.sound.audio.slice(0, sensed.sound.audio.lastIndexOf('/') + 1)"/>
          <send id="voice-detection-timer" event="bot.ability.listening.stage.failed" delayexpr="stage_timeout_ms + 'ms'">
            <content expr="({stage: stage, message: 'Listening ' + stage + ' timed out.'})"/>
          </send>
        </onentry>
        <onexit>
          <cancel sendid="voice-detection-timer"/>
        </onexit>
        <invoke id="voice_detection" type="scxml" src="voice_detection.scx">
          <param name="audio" expr="sensed.sound.audio"/>
          <param name="media_type" expr="sensed.sound.media_type === undefined ? null : sensed.sound.media_type"/>
          <param name="sample_rate_hz" expr="sensed.sound.sample_rate_hz === undefined ? null : sensed.sound.sample_rate_hz"/>
          <param name="channels" expr="sensed.sound.channels === undefined ? null : sensed.sound.channels"/>
          <param name="output" expr="media_dir + 'floppy-sound-' + serial + '.pcm'"/>
        </invoke>
        <transition event="done.invoke.voice_detection"
                    cond="Array.isArray(Object(Object(_event.data).voice_detection).segments) &amp;&amp; Object(_event.data).sound">
          <assign location="result" expr="_event.data"/>
          <assign location="detection" expr="({sensed: sensed, voice_detection: result.voice_detection})"/>
          <if cond="result.sound.audio !== sensed.sound.audio || result.sound.media_type !== (sensed.sound.media_type || null)">
            <assign location="detection.sensed" expr="({sound: Object.assign({}, sensed.sound, result.sound), parent: sensed.parent, perceived_level_db: sensed.perceived_level_db})"/>
          </if>
        </transition>
        <transition event="done.invoke.voice_detection" cond="typeof Object(_event.data).message !== 'string'">
          <send event="bot.ability.listening.stage.failed" target="#_internal">
            <content expr="({stage: stage, message: 'Voice detection child produced a non-ApplyData terminal.'})"/>
          </send>
        </transition>
        <!-- mosfet's routes, in its order. -->
        <transition cond="detection !== null &amp;&amp; detection.voice_detection.segments.length === 0 &amp;&amp; !sound_classifier &amp;&amp; speech_decoder"
                    target="Idle"/>
        <transition cond="detection !== null &amp;&amp; detection.voice_detection.segments.length === 0 &amp;&amp; !speech_decoder &amp;&amp; !sound_classifier"
                    target="HandingOff">
          <assign location="completion" expr="({kind: 'detection', sensed: detection.sensed, voice_detection: detection.voice_detection})"/>
        </transition>
        <transition cond="detection !== null &amp;&amp; detection.voice_detection.segments.length === 0 &amp;&amp; sound_classifier"
                    target="ClassifyingSound"/>
        <transition cond="detection !== null &amp;&amp; voice_classifier &amp;&amp; !diarizer" target="IdentifyingVoiceDirect"/>
        <!-- VAD Start: open the window with this frame. -->
        <transition cond="detection !== null" target="HearingSpeech">
          <assign location="open_sensed" expr="detection.sensed"/>
          <assign location="open_frames" expr="[detection.sensed.sound]"/>
        </transition>
      </state>

      <!-- The open-speech window: the next scored sound is fed to voice
           detection. -->
      <state id="HearingSpeech">
        <onentry>
          <assign location="stage" expr="null"/>
          <!-- The frame just heard, streamed when Listening owns no
               decoder (mosfet _emit_speech_product). -->
          <assign location="audible" expr="detection.sensed.perceived_level_db == null || detection.sensed.perceived_level_db &gt;= product_threshold_db"/>
          <assign location="audible" expr="audible &amp;&amp; !speech_decoder &amp;&amp; !diarizer &amp;&amp; typeof detection.sensed.sound.sample_rate_hz === 'number'"/>
          <if cond="audible &amp;&amp; detection.sensed.sound.media_type === 'audio/pcm' &amp;&amp; detection.sensed.sound.audio">
            <assign location="product" expr="({content: detection.sensed.sound.audio, content_type: 'audio/pcm', voice_detection: detection.voice_detection})"/>
            <assign location="product.sample_rate_hz" expr="detection.sensed.sound.sample_rate_hz"/>
            <assign location="product.channels" expr="typeof detection.sensed.sound.channels === 'number' ? detection.sensed.sound.channels : 1"/>
            <assign location="product.media_type" expr="'audio/pcm'"/>
            <assign location="product.source_ids" expr="active_source_ids"/>
            <assign location="product.voice_embedding" expr="active_voice_embedding"/>
            <assign location="product.parent" expr="detection.sensed.parent === undefined ? null : detection.sensed.parent"/>
            <send event="bot.ability.listening.speech.output" target="#_parent">
              <content expr="product"/>
            </send>
          </if>
        </onentry>
        <transition cond="queue.length &gt; 0" target="FeedingSpeech">
          <assign location="sensed" expr="queue.shift()"/>
        </transition>
        <transition event="bot.ability.listening.sensitivity.output" event:schema="schemas/bot.ability.listening.sensitivity.output.json"
                    cond="!_event.invokeid" target="FeedingSpeech">
          <assign location="sensed" expr="_event.data"/>
        </transition>
      </state>

      <!-- Voice detection on a sound with the window open. -->
      <state id="FeedingSpeech">
        <onentry>
          <assign location="stage" expr="'voice_detection'"/>
          <assign location="detection" expr="null"/>
          <assign location="serial" expr="serial + 1"/>
          <assign location="media_dir" expr="sensed.sound.audio.slice(0, sensed.sound.audio.lastIndexOf('/') + 1)"/>
          <send id="feeding-speech-timer" event="bot.ability.listening.stage.failed" delayexpr="stage_timeout_ms + 'ms'">
            <content expr="({stage: stage, message: 'Listening ' + stage + ' timed out.'})"/>
          </send>
        </onentry>
        <onexit>
          <cancel sendid="feeding-speech-timer"/>
        </onexit>
        <invoke id="speech_voice_detection" type="scxml" src="voice_detection.scx">
          <param name="audio" expr="sensed.sound.audio"/>
          <param name="media_type" expr="sensed.sound.media_type === undefined ? null : sensed.sound.media_type"/>
          <param name="sample_rate_hz" expr="sensed.sound.sample_rate_hz === undefined ? null : sensed.sound.sample_rate_hz"/>
          <param name="channels" expr="sensed.sound.channels === undefined ? null : sensed.sound.channels"/>
          <param name="output" expr="media_dir + 'floppy-sound-' + serial + '.pcm'"/>
        </invoke>
        <transition event="done.invoke.speech_voice_detection"
                    cond="Array.isArray(Object(Object(_event.data).voice_detection).segments) &amp;&amp; Object(_event.data).sound">
          <assign location="result" expr="_event.data"/>
          <assign location="detection" expr="({sensed: sensed, voice_detection: result.voice_detection})"/>
          <if cond="result.sound.audio !== sensed.sound.audio || result.sound.media_type !== (sensed.sound.media_type || null)">
            <assign location="detection.sensed" expr="({sound: Object.assign({}, sensed.sound, result.sound), parent: sensed.parent, perceived_level_db: sensed.perceived_level_db})"/>
          </if>
          <!-- The frame joins the utterance, voiced or not. -->
          <assign location="open_frames" expr="open_frames.concat([detection.sensed.sound])"/>
        </transition>
        <transition event="done.invoke.speech_voice_detection" cond="typeof Object(_event.data).message !== 'string'">
          <send event="bot.ability.listening.stage.failed" target="#_internal">
            <content expr="({stage: stage, message: 'Voice detection child produced a non-ApplyData terminal.'})"/>
          </send>
        </transition>
        <!-- Still in voice: the loudest frame is remembered. -->
        <transition cond="detection !== null &amp;&amp; detection.voice_detection.segments.length &gt; 0" target="HearingSpeech">
          <if cond="open_sensed === null || (open_sensed.perceived_level_db == null &amp;&amp; detection.sensed.perceived_level_db != null)">
            <assign location="open_sensed" expr="detection.sensed"/>
          <elseif cond="open_sensed.perceived_level_db != null &amp;&amp; detection.sensed.perceived_level_db &gt; open_sensed.perceived_level_db"/>
            <assign location="open_sensed" expr="detection.sensed"/>
          </if>
        </transition>
        <!-- VAD End. -->
        <transition cond="detection !== null" target="SpeechEnded"/>
      </state>

      <!-- After VAD End: the closing frame is streamed, then the utterance
           is joined for diarization or decoding. -->
      <state id="SpeechEnded">
        <onentry>
          <assign location="audible" expr="detection.sensed.perceived_level_db == null || detection.sensed.perceived_level_db &gt;= product_threshold_db"/>
          <assign location="audible" expr="audible &amp;&amp; !speech_decoder &amp;&amp; !diarizer &amp;&amp; typeof detection.sensed.sound.sample_rate_hz === 'number'"/>
          <if cond="audible &amp;&amp; detection.sensed.sound.media_type === 'audio/pcm' &amp;&amp; detection.sensed.sound.audio">
            <assign location="product" expr="({content: detection.sensed.sound.audio, content_type: 'audio/pcm', voice_detection: detection.voice_detection})"/>
            <assign location="product.sample_rate_hz" expr="detection.sensed.sound.sample_rate_hz"/>
            <assign location="product.channels" expr="typeof detection.sensed.sound.channels === 'number' ? detection.sensed.sound.channels : 1"/>
            <assign location="product.media_type" expr="'audio/pcm'"/>
            <assign location="product.source_ids" expr="active_source_ids"/>
            <assign location="product.voice_embedding" expr="active_voice_embedding"/>
            <assign location="product.parent" expr="detection.sensed.parent === undefined ? null : detection.sensed.parent"/>
            <send event="bot.ability.listening.speech.output" target="#_parent">
              <content expr="product"/>
            </send>
          </if>
          <assign location="stage" expr="diarizer ? 'voice_diarization' : 'speech_decoding'"/>
          <send id="open-speech-timer" event="bot.ability.listening.stage.failed" delayexpr="stage_timeout_ms + 'ms'">
            <content expr="({stage: stage, message: 'Listening ' + stage + ' timed out.'})"/>
          </send>
        </onentry>
        <onexit>
          <cancel sendid="open-speech-timer"/>
        </onexit>
        <transition cond="!diarizer &amp;&amp; !speech_decoder" target="Idle"/>
        <invoke id="open_speech" type="https://github.com/stateforward/floppy/services/speech">
          <param name="operation" expr="'append'"/>
          <param name="frames" expr="open_frames"/>
          <param name="output" expr="media_dir + 'floppy-utterance-' + serial + '.wav'"/>
          <param name="wav" expr="true"/>
        </invoke>
        <transition event="bot.ability.failed" event:schema="schemas/bot.ability.failed.json" cond="_event.invokeid === 'open_speech'">
          <send event="bot.ability.listening.stage.failed" target="#_internal">
            <content expr="({stage: stage, message: Object(_event.data).message})"/>
          </send>
        </transition>
        <transition event="done.invoke.open_speech" cond="diarizer &amp;&amp; typeof Object(_event.data).audio === 'string'" target="DiarizingVoice">
          <assign location="utterance" expr="_event.data"/>
        </transition>
        <transition event="done.invoke.open_speech" cond="typeof Object(_event.data).audio === 'string'" target="DecodingSpeech">
          <assign location="utterance" expr="_event.data"/>
        </transition>
      </state>

      <!-- Non-speech labelling: a labelled sound is not speech. -->
      <state id="ClassifyingSound">
        <onentry>
          <assign location="stage" expr="'sound_classification'"/>
          <send id="sound-classification-timer" event="bot.ability.listening.stage.failed" delayexpr="stage_timeout_ms + 'ms'">
            <content expr="({stage: stage, message: 'Listening ' + stage + ' timed out.'})"/>
          </send>
        </onentry>
        <onexit>
          <cancel sendid="sound-classification-timer"/>
        </onexit>
        <invoke id="sound_classification" type="scxml" src="sound_classification.scx">
          <param name="audio" expr="detection.sensed.sound.audio"/>
          <param name="media_type" expr="detection.sensed.sound.media_type === undefined ? null : detection.sensed.sound.media_type"/>
          <param name="kind" expr="detection.sensed.sound.kind === undefined ? null : detection.sensed.sound.kind"/>
        </invoke>
        <transition event="done.invoke.sound_classification"
                    cond="Array.isArray(Object(_event.data).labels) &amp;&amp; _event.data.labels.length &gt; 0" target="HandingOff">
          <assign location="completion" expr="({kind: 'labelled', sensed: detection.sensed, voice_detection: detection.voice_detection})"/>
        </transition>
        <transition event="done.invoke.sound_classification" cond="Array.isArray(Object(_event.data).labels) &amp;&amp; speech_decoder"
                    target="Idle"/>
        <transition event="done.invoke.sound_classification" cond="Array.isArray(Object(_event.data).labels)" target="HandingOff">
          <assign location="completion" expr="({kind: 'detection', sensed: detection.sensed, voice_detection: detection.voice_detection})"/>
        </transition>
        <transition event="done.invoke.sound_classification">
          <send event="bot.ability.listening.stage.failed" target="#_internal">
            <content expr="({stage: stage, message: 'Sound classification child produced invalid output.'})"/>
          </send>
        </transition>
      </state>

      <!-- Who spoke when in the closed utterance. -->
      <state id="DiarizingVoice">
        <onentry>
          <assign location="stage" expr="'voice_diarization'"/>
          <send id="voice-diarization-timer" event="bot.ability.listening.stage.failed" delayexpr="stage_timeout_ms + 'ms'">
            <content expr="({stage: stage, message: 'Listening ' + stage + ' timed out.'})"/>
          </send>
        </onentry>
        <onexit>
          <cancel sendid="voice-diarization-timer"/>
        </onexit>
        <invoke id="voice_diarization" type="scxml" src="voice_diarization.scx">
          <param name="audio" expr="utterance.audio"/>
          <param name="media_type" expr="utterance.media_type"/>
          <param name="sample_rate_hz" expr="utterance.sample_rate_hz"/>
          <param name="channels" expr="utterance.channels"/>
          <param name="output" expr="media_dir + 'floppy-diarized-' + serial"/>
        </invoke>
        <transition event="done.invoke.voice_diarization" cond="Array.isArray(Object(_event.data).segments) &amp;&amp; voice_classifier"
                    target="IdentifyingVoice">
          <assign location="completion" expr="({kind: 'diarization', sensed: open_sensed || detection.sensed, voice_detection: detection.voice_detection})"/>
          <assign location="completion.segments" expr="_event.data.segments"/>
        </transition>
        <transition event="done.invoke.voice_diarization" cond="Array.isArray(Object(_event.data).segments) &amp;&amp; speech_decoder"
                    target="Diarized">
          <assign location="completion" expr="({kind: 'diarization', sensed: open_sensed || detection.sensed, voice_detection: detection.voice_detection})"/>
          <assign location="completion.segments" expr="_event.data.segments"/>
        </transition>
        <transition event="done.invoke.voice_diarization" cond="Array.isArray(Object(_event.data).segments)" target="HandingOff">
          <assign location="completion" expr="({kind: 'diarization', sensed: open_sensed || detection.sensed, voice_detection: detection.voice_detection})"/>
          <assign location="completion.segments" expr="_event.data.segments"/>
        </transition>
        <transition event="done.invoke.voice_diarization" cond="typeof Object(_event.data).message !== 'string'">
          <send event="bot.ability.listening.stage.failed" target="#_internal">
            <content expr="({stage: stage, message: 'Voice diarization child produced invalid output.'})"/>
          </send>
        </transition>
      </state>

      <!-- Direct identification of the opening voice span. -->
      <state id="IdentifyingVoiceDirect">
        <onentry>
          <assign location="stage" expr="'voice_identification'"/>
          <send id="direct-identification-timer" event="bot.ability.listening.stage.failed" delayexpr="stage_timeout_ms + 'ms'">
            <content expr="({stage: stage, message: 'Listening ' + stage + ' timed out.'})"/>
          </send>
          <assign location="mismatch" expr="'voice identification requires audio/pcm with sample rate and channels.'"/>
          <if cond="detection.sensed.sound.media_type !== 'audio/pcm' || typeof detection.sensed.sound.sample_rate_hz !== 'number'">
            <send event="bot.ability.listening.stage.failed" target="#_internal">
              <content expr="({stage: stage, message: 'Voice identification opening segment conversion failed: ' + mismatch})"/>
            </send>
          </if>
        </onentry>
        <onexit>
          <cancel sendid="direct-identification-timer"/>
        </onexit>
        <invoke id="direct_voice_identification" type="scxml" src="voice_identification.scx">
          <param name="audio" expr="detection.sensed.sound.audio"/>
          <param name="sample_rate_hz" expr="detection.sensed.sound.sample_rate_hz"/>
          <param name="channels" expr="typeof detection.sensed.sound.channels === 'number' ? detection.sensed.sound.channels : 1"/>
          <param name="start_seconds" expr="detection.voice_detection.segments[0].start_seconds"/>
          <param name="end_seconds" expr="detection.voice_detection.segments[0].end_seconds"/>
          <param name="output" expr="media_dir + 'floppy-voice-' + serial + '.pcm'"/>
        </invoke>
        <transition event="done.invoke.direct_voice_identification"
                    cond="Array.isArray(Object(_event.data).embeddings) &amp;&amp; _event.data.embeddings.length === 0">
          <send event="bot.ability.listening.stage.failed" target="#_internal">
            <content expr="({stage: stage, message: 'Voice identification produced no opening embedding.'})"/>
          </send>
        </transition>
        <!-- The first segment's identity is committed, then the window
             opens with this frame. -->
        <transition event="done.invoke.direct_voice_identification" cond="Array.isArray(Object(_event.data).embeddings)" target="HearingSpeech">
          <assign location="active_voice_embedding" expr="_event.data.embeddings[0]"/>
          <assign location="active_source_ids" expr="[active_voice_embedding.embedding]"/>
          <assign location="open_sensed" expr="detection.sensed"/>
          <assign location="open_frames" expr="[detection.sensed.sound]"/>
        </transition>
        <transition event="done.invoke.direct_voice_identification" cond="typeof Object(_event.data).message !== 'string'">
          <send event="bot.ability.listening.stage.failed" target="#_internal">
            <content expr="({stage: stage, message: 'Voice identification child produced invalid output.'})"/>
          </send>
        </transition>
      </state>

      <!-- One embedding per diarized segment. -->
      <state id="IdentifyingVoice">
        <onentry>
          <assign location="stage" expr="'voice_identification'"/>
          <send id="voice-identification-timer" event="bot.ability.listening.stage.failed" delayexpr="stage_timeout_ms + 'ms'">
            <content expr="({stage: stage, message: 'Listening ' + stage + ' timed out.'})"/>
          </send>
        </onentry>
        <onexit>
          <cancel sendid="voice-identification-timer"/>
        </onexit>
        <invoke id="voice_identification" type="scxml" src="voice_identification.scx">
          <param name="segments" expr="completion.segments"/>
        </invoke>
        <transition event="done.invoke.voice_identification"
                    cond="Array.isArray(Object(_event.data).embeddings) &amp;&amp; _event.data.embeddings.length !== completion.segments.length">
          <assign location="mismatch" expr="'received ' + _event.data.embeddings.length + ' for ' + completion.segments.length + ' segments.'"/>
          <send event="bot.ability.listening.stage.failed" target="#_internal">
            <content expr="({stage: stage, message: 'Voice identification must return exactly one embedding per voice segment; ' + mismatch})"/>
          </send>
        </transition>
        <transition event="done.invoke.voice_identification" cond="Array.isArray(Object(_event.data).embeddings)" target="HandingOff">
          <assign location="completion.kind" expr="'identification'"/>
          <assign location="completion.embeddings" expr="_event.data.embeddings"/>
        </transition>
        <transition event="done.invoke.voice_identification" cond="typeof Object(_event.data).message !== 'string'">
          <send event="bot.ability.listening.stage.failed" target="#_internal">
            <content expr="({stage: stage, message: 'Voice identification child produced invalid output.'})"/>
          </send>
        </transition>
      </state>

      <!-- Speech decoding rewrites the observation into words. -->
      <state id="DecodingSpeech" initial="Detected">
        <onentry>
          <assign location="stage" expr="'speech_decoding'"/>
          <send id="speech-decoding-timer" event="bot.ability.listening.stage.failed" delayexpr="stage_timeout_ms + 'ms'">
            <content expr="({stage: stage, message: 'Listening ' + stage + ' timed out.'})"/>
          </send>
        </onentry>
        <onexit>
          <cancel sendid="speech-decoding-timer"/>
        </onexit>
        <invoke id="speech_decoding" type="scxml" src="speech_decoding.scx">
          <param name="audio" expr="utterance.audio"/>
          <param name="media_type" expr="utterance.media_type"/>
        </invoke>
        <transition event="done.invoke.speech_decoding" cond="typeof Object(_event.data).text === 'string'" target="HandingOff">
          <assign location="completion" expr="({kind: 'decoding', sensed: open_sensed || detection.sensed, voice_detection: detection.voice_detection, text: _event.data.text})"/>
        </transition>
        <transition event="done.invoke.speech_decoding" cond="typeof Object(_event.data).message !== 'string'">
          <send event="bot.ability.listening.stage.failed" target="#_internal">
            <content expr="({stage: stage, message: 'Speech decoding child produced a non-bytes terminal.'})"/>
          </send>
        </transition>
        <!-- From the window directly, or after diarization. -->
        <state id="Detected"/>
        <state id="Diarized"/>
      </state>

      <!-- The one comparison: is enough of this left for a turn? -->
      <state id="HandingOff">
        <onentry>
          <assign location="stage" expr="null"/>
          <assign location="audible" expr="completion.sensed.perceived_level_db == null || completion.sensed.perceived_level_db &gt;= product_threshold_db"/>
          <assign location="product" expr="null"/>
        </onentry>
        <transition cond="!audible" target="Idle"/>
        <transition cond="completion.kind === 'decoding' &amp;&amp; typeof completion.sensed.sound.sample_rate_hz !== 'number'" target="Idle">
          <send event="bot.ability.listening.failed" target="#_parent">
            <content expr="({stage: 'speech_decoding', message: 'Speech decoding completed on sound with no sample rate to place it on a timeline.'})"/>
          </send>
        </transition>
        <!-- Decoding rewrites this observation: it becomes words. -->
        <transition cond="completion.kind === 'decoding'" target="Idle">
          <assign location="product" expr="({content: completion.text, content_type: 'text/plain', voice_detection: completion.voice_detection})"/>
          <assign location="product.sample_rate_hz" expr="completion.sensed.sound.sample_rate_hz"/>
          <assign location="product.channels" expr="typeof completion.sensed.sound.channels === 'number' ? completion.sensed.sound.channels : 1"/>
          <assign location="product.media_type" expr="'audio/pcm'"/>
          <assign location="product.source_ids" expr="[]"/>
          <assign location="product.parent" expr="completion.sensed.parent === undefined ? null : completion.sensed.parent"/>
          <send event="bot.ability.listening.speech.output" target="#_parent">
            <content expr="product"/>
          </send>
        </transition>
        <!-- One speech product per clipped segment, each in the format of
             the sound it came from. -->
        <transition cond="completion.kind === 'diarization' || completion.kind === 'identification'" target="Idle">
          <assign location="mismatch" expr="completion.sensed.sound.media_type !== 'audio/pcm' || typeof completion.sensed.sound.sample_rate_hz !== 'number'"/>
          <assign location="mismatch" expr="mismatch ? 'voice segment speech requires source audio/pcm with a sample rate.' : null"/>
          <assign location="channels" expr="typeof completion.sensed.sound.channels === 'number' ? completion.sensed.sound.channels : 1"/>
          <foreach array="completion.segments" item="product">
            <if cond="mismatch === null &amp;&amp; product.sample_rate_hz !== completion.sensed.sound.sample_rate_hz">
              <assign location="mismatch" expr="'voice segment audio format does not match its source audio.'"/>
            <elseif cond="mismatch === null &amp;&amp; (product.channels !== channels || product.media_type !== 'audio/pcm')"/>
              <assign location="mismatch" expr="'voice segment audio format does not match its source audio.'"/>
            </if>
          </foreach>
          <if cond="mismatch !== null">
            <send event="bot.ability.listening.failed" target="#_parent">
              <content expr="({stage: 'voice_' + completion.kind, message: 'Voice ' + completion.kind + ' product conversion failed: ' + mismatch})"/>
            </send>
          <else/>
            <foreach array="completion.segments" item="segment" index="index">
              <assign location="result" expr="completion.kind === 'identification' ? completion.embeddings[index] : null"/>
              <assign location="product" expr="({content: segment.audio, content_type: 'audio/pcm', media_type: 'audio/pcm'})"/>
              <assign location="product.sample_rate_hz" expr="segment.sample_rate_hz"/>
              <assign location="product.channels" expr="segment.channels"/>
              <assign location="product.start_seconds" expr="segment.start_seconds"/>
              <assign location="product.end_seconds" expr="segment.end_seconds"/>
              <assign location="product.confidence" expr="segment.confidence === undefined ? null : segment.confidence"/>
              <assign location="product.voice_detection" expr="({segments: [{start_seconds: 0.0, end_seconds: segment.end_seconds - segment.start_seconds}]})"/>
              <assign location="product.voice_detection.segments[0].confidence" expr="product.confidence"/>
              <assign location="product.source_ids" expr="result === null ? [] : [result.embedding]"/>
              <assign location="product.voice_embedding" expr="result"/>
              <assign location="product.parent" expr="completion.sensed.parent === undefined ? null : completion.sensed.parent"/>
              <send event="bot.ability.listening.speech.output" target="#_parent">
                <content expr="product"/>
              </send>
            </foreach>
          </if>
        </transition>
        <!-- A silence observation: the sound's PCM with its spans. -->
        <transition cond="completion.kind === 'detection' &amp;&amp; completion.sensed.sound.media_type === 'audio/pcm' &amp;&amp; completion.sensed.sound.audio"
                    target="Idle">
          <if cond="typeof completion.sensed.sound.sample_rate_hz === 'number'">
            <assign location="product" expr="({content: completion.sensed.sound.audio, content_type: 'audio/pcm', voice_detection: completion.voice_detection})"/>
            <assign location="product.sample_rate_hz" expr="completion.sensed.sound.sample_rate_hz"/>
            <assign location="product.channels" expr="typeof completion.sensed.sound.channels === 'number' ? completion.sensed.sound.channels : 1"/>
            <assign location="product.media_type" expr="'audio/pcm'"/>
            <assign location="product.source_ids" expr="[]"/>
            <assign location="product.parent" expr="completion.sensed.parent === undefined ? null : completion.sensed.parent"/>
            <send event="bot.ability.listening.speech.output" target="#_parent">
              <content expr="product"/>
            </send>
          <else/>
            <send event="environment.sound" target="#_parent">
              <content expr="completion.sensed.sound"/>
            </send>
          </if>
        </transition>
        <!-- Labelled non-speech, or a sound that is not PCM. -->
        <transition target="Idle">
          <send event="environment.sound" target="#_parent">
            <content expr="completion.sensed.sound"/>
          </send>
        </transition>
      </state>
    </state>
  </state>

  <final id="degraded"/>
</scxml>
